OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidespread dense fog will be
OL,6,Fslow to clear on Monday morning, but
OL,7,Fsome sunny spells gradually
OL,8,Fdeveloping. Any showers on
OL,9,FLincolnshire coasts will slowly die
OL,10,Fout. Feeling cool, especially where
OL,11,Ffog lingers.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA dry evening is expected,
OL,14,Fwith clear spells developing, allowing
OL,15,Fsome mist, fog and frost patches to
OL,16,Fdevelop during the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
