OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FAreas of fog will be slow to
OL,6,Fclear on Tuesday morning. Some
OL,7,Fbrightness developing before cloud
OL,8,Fthickens in the afternoon, ahead of
OL,9,Frain arriving later. Turning breezy.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA wet
OL,12,Fand breezy start Wednesday, turning
OL,13,Fdry later. Mostly dry with sunny
OL,14,Fspells Thursday and Friday, isolated
OL,15,Fshowers on Thursday. Temperatures
OL,16,Fturning cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
